<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">2 Timothea</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timothea</para>
  <para style="toc1">2 Timothea</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timothea</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Timothea</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Kei Paula, Kristaa nunna tiam puang tûra Pathian duh zâwnga Krista Isua tirhkoh hian,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />ka fapa duh tak Timothe, chibai ka bûk a che. Pa Pathian leh kan Lalpa Krista Isua hnên ata khawngaihna te, zahngaihna te, remna te i hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Min thlahtute tih anga chhia leh ṭha hriatna thiang taka a rawng ka bâwl Pathian hnênah lâwmthu ka sawi a ni. A chhûn a zânin ka ṭawngṭainaah te ka hre reng ṭhîn che a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />i mittuite pawh ka hre reng a, hlim êm êma inhmuh leh ka châk ngei mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />I rinna takzia pawh ka hre reng ṭhîn, i pi Loisii neih, i nu Euniki pawhin a neih bawk kha nang pawhin i nei ta zêl a ni tih ka hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Chumi avâng chuan i chunga kut ka nghah laia Pathian thilpêk i dawn kha chhêm alh reng tûrin hrilh nawn che ka duh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian Thlarau kan chan hian min tidawih lo va, chakna te, hmangaihna te, mahni inthunun theihna te min pe zâwk a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Kan Lalpa thu hi puan zak suh, amah avânga lung in tâng pawh hi min zahpui hek suh; Pathian chakna ringin Chanchin Ṭha avânga hrehawm tuar ve huam zêl zâwk rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kan thiltih avâng ni lovin, ama tum dân a nih zâwk avângin khawngaihnain min chhandam a, thianghlim taka nung tûrin min ko va ni. Krista Isuaah chuan leilung pian hma daih khân a khawngaihna chu min lo pe tawh a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />mahse, tûnah hian, min chhandamtu Krista Isua a lo kal khân, chu chu tihlan a ni ta chauh a ni. Ani chuan thihna chu a hneh ta a, Chanchin Ṭhaah hian nunna leh thih theih lohna a rawn tilang ta a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kei hi chumi thu puang tûra tirhkoh leh zirtîrtu atân ruat ka ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvâng chuan alâwm tûnah pawh hetianga ka tuar ni; mahse, ka zak lo ve; ka rina chu ka hria, a hnêna ka kawltîr chu, chumi Nî atân chuan a vawng him thei tih ka hre chiang a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ka hnên aṭanga i hriat ṭhin zirtîrna dik kha zawm berah neih la, Krista Isuaa rinnaah leh hmangaihnaah chuan chêng tlat rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />I kova innghat, thilpêk ropui tak kha, keimahnia chêng ṭhîn Thlarau Ṭhianghlim hmangin vawng ṭha tlat bawk rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Asia rama mite khân, Fugela leh Hermogena te chenin mi hawisan ta tih i hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa chuan Onesifora te chhûng chu khawngaihna pe rawh se; ani chuan mi tihlim êm êm a ni, lung in tâng ka nih hi mi zahpui lo va,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Rom khua a lo thlen veleh mi rawn zawng chhuak vang vang a ni. Efesi khuaah pawh min puih nasatzia i hre chiang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chuan chumi Nî-ah chuan a khawngaihna chu dawntîr rawh se.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ka fapa, Krista khawngaihna hian tichak che rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi tam tak hriata ka zirtîrna i ngaihthlâkte kha zirtîr chhâwng zêl thei tûr nia i mi rin tâwkte hnênah hrilh chhâwng zêl ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Krista sipai rinawm angin hrehawm mi tuarpui ve rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sipai chu a hotu tilâwm tûrin khawvêl thil dangah a inhnamhnawih ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Intlânsiak mi pawh dân ang taka a tlân loh chuan lâwmman a hmu thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lo lamah pawh a thawk hahtu chuan rah hmasa a chang tûr a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Ka sawi hi ngaihtuah ngun la, Lalpan kawng engkimah hriatthiamna a pe ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chanchin Ṭha ka hril ṭhin, Isua Krista, Davida thlaha mi, mitthi zîng ata tholeh ta-a thu kha hre reng rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chu Chanchin Ṭha avâng chuan hrehawm ka tuar a, mi sual ang maia khaidiata phuar ka ni, Pathian thu erawh chu phuar rual a ni lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Krista Isuaa awm, chhandamna chu, chatuan ropuina nên an chan theih nân thlante avângin hêng zawng zawng hi ka tuar a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />He thu hi a dik a ni: A thihna kan ṭâwm ve chuan, A nunna pawh kan ṭâwm ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kan tuar ve chuan ro kan rêlpui ve ang. Kan phat erawh chuan min phat ve ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Rinawm lo mah ila, Ani zawng a rinawm reng a, a thu a sût ve ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Hêng thu hi hriattîr rawh, Pathian hmingin hrilh la, thu inchuha inhnial ṭhin hi bânsan rawh se, sâwtna a awm lo va, ngaithlatute a tikhawlo mai mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nang chuan Pathian lâwmzâwng mi, hna thawktu, mahni hna zahpui lo, thutak chu dik taka hmang thiamtu nih tum tlat ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khawvêl mite thu dukdak lo chu hawisan rawh, chu chuan Pathian ngaihsak lohna lamah mi a hruai si ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Pânchhia angin an thu zirtîr chu a darh ṭhîn; an zîngah Humenaia leh Fileta kha a bulpui an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Thutak chu an pênsan a, ‘thawhlehna chu a awm daih tawh,’ an ti a, mi ṭhenkhat rinna pawh an pheh chhiatsak tawh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Pathian thutak lungphûm erawh chu a nghîng chuang lo, “Lalpan a mite a hria,” tih leh “Lalpa hming lamtute chuan sual an kalsan tûr a ni,” tih ziak a chuang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />In ropui taka bungbêlte pawh chu rangkachak leh tangkaruaa siam a ni vek lo va, thinga siam te, hluma siam te pawh a ni a, a ṭhen a hlu deuh va, a ṭhen a hlu lo deuh va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Hêng thil ṭha lo ka sawite laka inthiarfihlîm mi chu hmanraw hlu, in Neitupa tân hman tlâk, sil fai diam, hna ṭha tinrêng thawh nâna hman mai theih tûra inpeih reng ang hi a lo ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Tleirâwl châkna te hawisan la, thinlung thianghlim taka Lalpa lamtute nên dikna te, rinna te, hmangaihna te, remna te ûm rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Hêng inhnialna sâwt lo leh âtthlâk hi hawisan rawh, innghirnghona a tichhuak mai mai a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Lalpa chhiahhlawh chuan inhau a chîng tûr a ni lo, mi lainat thei, zirtîr thiam, mi dawhthei a ni zâwk tûr a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />amah kalhtute pawh dawhthei takin a kilkawi tûr a ni, thutak hre tûrin Pathianin an rilru a lamlêttîr mai thei a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Diabola thanga âwk, a duh zâwng a tihtîr ṭhinte chu lo chhuakin an lo harh leh mahna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Ni hnuhnûngah chuan hun khirh tak a lo thleng dâwn tih hre rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Mi, mahni hmasial te, tangka ngaina te, inchhuang te; intivei te, Pathian pawi sawi hrât te, nu leh pa thu awih lo te, lâwm nachâng hre lo te, thianghlim lo te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />pianpui hmangaihna nei lo te, huaikawm bâwl te, rêlchhiat chîng te, insûm thei lo te, nunrâwng te, ṭha hua te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />dâwta hêk chîng te, pawisak nei lo te, chapo te, Pathian aia mahni nuam tih zâwng ngaihtuahtu te,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />a langa intisakhaw mi viau, chhûng lama takna nei si lo te an lo awm ang - chûng mite chu hawisan rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />An zînga ṭhenkhat phei chu mi inahte an lêng an lêng ang a; hmeichhe chak lo anmahni rit phur, châk zâwng apiang ûm ruai,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />eng pawh zir peih viau, thutak hre thei bawk si lote chu an hîp ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Jannia leh Jambrian Mosia an dodâl ang khân thutak an dodâl ang; an rilru a khawlo zo tawh a, rinnaah lah tihtlâk an ni tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Chûng bâk chu eng dang han ti thei tûr an ni lo, Jannia leh Jambria te ang bawk khân miten an âtzia an hai lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Nang zawngin ka zirtîrna te, ka awm dân te, ka thiltum te, ka rinna te, ka dawhtheihna te, ka hmangaihna te leh ka chhelzia te i hria a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Antiokei-ah te, Ikonion-ah te leh Lustra khuaah te tihduhdahna leh harsatna tam tak ka chunga lo thleng te, tihduhdahna ka tuar nasatzia leh chûng ata chu Lalpan mi chhan chhuah thu te kha i hria e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tu pawhin Krista Isua nun mawi tak anga nun an tum phawt chuan tihduhdah an ni ngei ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi sualte leh tihdertute erawh chu an chan a chhe tial tial ang a, mi dang bum ṭhîn mah se anmahni ngei pawh bum an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Nang erawh chuan, i zir tawh, i pawm ngheh tawh kha chelh tlat rawh, tu nge zirtîr che i hre si a. I naupan têt ata Lehkha Thianghlim chu i hre bel êm êm a, Krista Isua rin avânga chhandam ni tûra finna pe thei che a ni tih i hria.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Pathian thâwkkhum Lehkha Thu zawng zawng hi intihdik nân te, insiamṭhat nân te, nun dân dik inzirtîr nân te a ṭangkai êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chutianga hmang chuan a ni Pathian mi chu hman tlâk a lo niha, thil ṭha tinrêng ti thei tûra thuam a lo nih ṭhin ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Pathian leh Krista Isua, mitthi leh mi nung rorêltu tûra hmaah, a lo kal lehna leh a ram chhâlin thu ka pe a che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thu chu hril rawh, hun ṭhaah emaw, ṭha lovah emaw bei zêl rawh; dawhthei taka zirtîr chungin an dik lohna kawhhmuh la, zilh la, fuih rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zirtîrna dik ngaithla ṭha duh lovin an duh zâwng chauh ngaithlain, an bengverh zâwng zirtîrtute chauh an sâwm khâwm hun a la thleng dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Thu dik an bengkhawn lo vang a, thawnthu mai mai an tuipui ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Nang zawng engkimah inthunun la, tuar fan fan rawh; Chanchin Ṭha hril hna hi thawk zêl la, i rawngbâwl hna kha hlen rawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Kei zawng hlan tûra tih ka ni tawh, khawvêl ata ka kal chhuah hun a thleng ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Intihsiakna ṭha chu ka zo tawh a, ka tlânna tûrah ka tlân chhuak a, rinna chu ka vawng reng a ni;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />tûnah chuan thiam channa, chawimawina lukhum chu dawn chauh ka hmabâk tawh a ni; chu chu rorêltu dik Lalpa chuan, chumi ni-ah chuan min pe ang, keimah mai ni lovin, a lo lan hun nghâkhleltu zawng zawngte pawh a pe ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ka hnêna lo kal thuai han tum hrâm teh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Dema chuan tûnlai khawvêl a ngainat avângin Thesalonika khaw lamah mi kalsan ta. Kreska pawh Galatia ramah a kal a, Tita chu Dalmatia ramah a kal bawk a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Luka chauhvin mi awmpui a ni. Marka kha rawngbâwl kawnga mi puitu ṭha tak a ni a, rawn hruai ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tukika kha Efesi khuaah ka tîr ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />I lo kal hun chuan Troas khuaa Karpa hnêna ka kawrfual hnutchhiah kha han la la, ka lehkhabu nên, savun lehkhate phei kha chu han keng ngei ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Dâr chhûng mi Aleksandara khân ka pawi a khawih nasa hle a, Lalpan a thiltih ang zêlin a la thungrûl ang chu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A lakah khân nang pawh fîmkhur hle ang che, kan thu a dodâl nasa êm êm a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Thiamthu ka sawi hmasak ṭum chuan tu mah mi ṭantu an awm lo, min tlânsan vek a, (a mawh chu phur hlawm suh se).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Lalpa erawh chuan mi awmpui a, mi tichak a, Jentail zawng zawng hriat tûrin Chanchin Ṭha chu ka puang kim ta; sakeibaknei ka ata chhan chhuah ka ni ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Lalpa chuan thil ṭha lo tinrêng lak ata mi chhan chhuak zêl ang a, him takin a vânram chu min thlen ang. Chatuan chatuanin ropuina chu a hnênah awm rawh se. Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Priskili leh Akuila te leh Onesifora chhûngte kha chibai ka bûk e.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Erasta chu Korinth khuaah a awm ta reng a. Trofima chu a dam loh avângin Mileto khuaah ka kalsan ta.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Thlasik hmain lo kal tum hrâm ang che.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Eubula te, Pudea te, Lina te, Klaudii te leh unau zawng zawngten chibai an bûk a che. Lalpa chu i hnênah awm rawh se. Khawngaihna in zaa hnênah awm rawh se.
  </para>
</usx>
